# @ada74m/featurewise-ui, the shell's contract and module builder, comes from the owner's GitHub Packages
# registry, which needs GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN set to a token that can read packages: in CI, the workflow's
# token; locally, export GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN=$(gh auth token), after gh auth refresh -s read:packages.
@ada74m:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN}
